+package com.artflow.studio.domain.model.animation
+
+import kotlinx.serialization.Serializable
+
+/**
+ * Animation Assist's Background and Foreground for one layer.
+ *
+ * A pinned layer belongs to the frame whose stack holds it (that is where it is edited, once) and is
+ * shown on every other frame as well: [BACKGROUND] layers beneath the frame's own layers,
+ * [FOREGROUND] layers above them. Pinning a group pins everything inside it. The selection rules
+ * are in [com.artflow.studio.core.animation.PinnedLayers]; layers do not carry a pin in the document
+ * yet, so nothing in the editor sets or reads one.
+ */
+@Serializable
+enum class FramePin {
+    NONE,
+    BACKGROUND,
+    FOREGROUND,
+}
